WEBVTT

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:07.310
March 29 15:28

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:20.620
You didn't want your son to 
hear me say any more, did you?

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:24.750
If you keep spouting nonsense,

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:29.090
I'll shut your mouth forever.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.120
Dear me, how scary.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.930
Are you actually trying to kill me?

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:53.440
Well, that's fine. The same goes for me!

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:59.240
You know, my left eye...

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:02.200
It was Victor who sliced it up.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:05.210
I'm quite a wimp, after all.

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:10.060
Ever since then, I've thought of 
nothing but how I could get revenge.

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:10.960
Then, one day...

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:15.230
I had a great idea!

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:49.680
I had a great idea!

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:54.440
All I had to do was kill his wife!

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:57.280
Child's play!

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:00.350
You're fast, but that's all.

00:03:00.350 --> 00:03:01.990
You have no technique!

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:04.480
What?

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:05.240
Speed Up!

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:20.050
Our little game is over.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:23.140
Just let that Horologue you can 
no longer control eat you.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:26.360
Oh, I'm done for...

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:29.140
Just kidding!

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:32.480
Why?!

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:35.270
Why? Come on, now.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:40.030
I had no idea you were such a naïve girl.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:45.200
Did you honestly think I'd wear the real 
ring where it could be seen so easily?

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:48.160
I've kept it hidden, of course!

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:53.670
Well, that's fine, then.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:56.250
I just need to defeat the Horologue itself.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:59.210
I'll cook you up after that!

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:13.110
I can't... move...

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:16.810
Ah, I see it's finally kicked in.

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:23.240
I have no technique, do I?

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:28.200
You only say that because you don't 
understand how a Horologue ought to be used.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:31.410
How it ought... to be used?

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.980
A Horologue's staple diet is time.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:38.210
Time includes memories, 
experiences, and abilities.

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:43.510
When a Horologue eats time, 
it also gains those things.

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:46.510
And this one's name is Fudoku.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:53.580
Wolf's bane, scorpions, frogs, 
tarantulas, cobras...

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:56.520
It's eaten all manner of toxic organisms.

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:59.190
You get the rest, right?

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:02.530
When you shielded your beloved son,

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:05.780
neurotoxins invaded your body.

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.180
Oh, but don't worry.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:12.390
The effects of that poison only
lasts one to two hours at most.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:18.710
Oh, but there are some things I'd like to 
test out on you in the meantime.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:21.920
Where should we start?

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:27.890
I am the Sixth Chronos Ruler, Blaze!

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:31.390
An old geezer like you is no match for me,

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:33.350
but I know fate when I see it.

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:34.930
Speed Up!

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:49.240
You're kidding me.

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:52.870
A little old man like you blocked my attack?

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.410
How?

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:58.090
A Horologue? An Oath of Time?

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:00.630
There's no way you did that on your own!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:05.630
My existence, down to the last drop 
of my blood, belongs to His Majesty.

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:06.830
Huh?

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:10.260
Everyone keeps talking about "His Majesty."
Who the hell is that?

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:14.010
His Majesty gave me a new body,

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:17.480
and from him I received a new life.

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:18.850
Life?

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.660
Therefore, His Majesty's orders...

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:27.360
are absolute, even if they cost me my life!

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:32.370
Wh-What the hell?!

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:35.350
You fused with a Horologue?

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:38.040
What kind of psycho are you?!

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.920
When I was very young,

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:45.260
disease caused my muscles to atrophy, 
and my parents abandoned me.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:04.780
It was His Majesty who took me in.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:09.920
By transplanting a Horologue into my flesh,

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:12.240
I gained a new body.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:17.750
His Majesty is both a father and 
a god to me, and that is why...

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:22.700
I will not allow anyone to 
stand in His Majesty's way!

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:33.180
That's such a great story.
You've really had it rough, old man.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.450
And this "His Majesty" must 
be a great guy, too.

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:40.020
You understand the compassion 
of His Majesty?

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:41.990
Of course I do!

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:45.770
But old man, there's someone 
who's important to me, too!

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:47.650
And to protect my kid brother, Kiri...

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:50.780
In the name of evil, I will defeat you!

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.490
The strength of your will is admirable!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:55.780
I will face you, young one!

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:03.970
His Majesty has granted me the 
agility of a monkey-type Horologue,

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:06.250
as well as great strength.

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:08.920
A monkey, huh?

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:13.030
If you're a monkey, then I'm 
the incarnation of a dragon.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:14.680
You know what that means?

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:18.170
I'm a hell of a lot stronger than you!

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:17.390
<b>Speed Up</b>

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:23.390
A mere sparrow cannot soar with eagles!

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.660
Damn, old man.

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:39.160
You're tougher than I thought.

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:45.750
Now I don't mind showing you how 
much power my fist really packs!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:06.430
The wisdom of my martial arts and 
the peerless might of the Horologue

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:11.070
come together in me to complete 
the ultimate fighting force!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:20.950
Now...

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:26.210
This one has poison that kills by bleeding 
all the blood out of your body,

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:32.210
and this one has poison that kills by shock 
resulting from the illusion of pain.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.960
And this one...

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:39.300
has a slightly more gentle poison 
that puts you in dreamland forever.

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:42.810
Which of the three poisons would you like,

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:45.210
mademoiselle?

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:47.480
I think you mean four poisons.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:51.570
You left out the one where I 
bite you and you die from poison.

00:09:53.310 --> 00:09:55.470
Playing tough, eh, little Nana?

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:58.740
Then, out of respect to your courage...

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:01.200
I'll try them all on you!

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.830
My poison is finally taking effect.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:15.300
What... just happened?

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:16.930
Why did they disappear?

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:19.930
I just told you.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:20.930
It was poison.

00:10:21.340 --> 00:10:23.350
Did you say... poison?

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:28.350
How... did you...

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:32.860
The blood of Chronos has the 
power to purify Horologues.

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:33.950
What...

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:36.300
You didn't know, did you?

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:39.240
From the moment your Horologue wounded me,

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:42.420
my blood was already starting to work.

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:44.580
My blood purifies Horologues

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:47.120
and, naturally, detoxifies 
any poisons they possess.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.830
Fight poison with poison...

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:54.130
An appropriate idiom for you.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:56.840
Purifying power? That can't be...

00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:59.250
Just what are you—

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:06.050
What? Sorry, I can't hear you.

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:08.680
I've created a vacuum around you!

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:13.190
If you'd kept your mouth shut,
you could've lived a little longer.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:17.570
But now that you know too much, 
I need you to go away...

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:21.260
Forever.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:35.590
What's the matter, boy? Out of moves?

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:39.240
<i>Damn, damn! I can't just go down like this!</i>

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:41.590
<i>Come up with something, me! 
You've gotta do this, me!</i>

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:46.760
Young one, do you still intend to fight?

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:50.100
This isn't enough!

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.850
I'm the world's top villain, you know!

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:57.480
You certainly do have guts!

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:01.860
But when I can see your attacks coming,
no degree of speed can—

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:05.740
Is this... gunpowder?

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:08.620
It's maintaining a gradual burn!

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:10.330
Finally figured it out, huh?

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:12.920
Too late!

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.380
Lightning Fire Bomb!

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:19.610
<i>He Slowed Down countless burning sparks</i>

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:22.710
<i>and dispersed them all around me?!</i>

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:25.140
<i>I can't dodge this many of them!</i>

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.870
<i>And although each individual one is small,</i>

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:30.890
<i>the effect of this many 
of them together is...</i>

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:35.950
<i>...immense!</i>

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.760
Old man... I've won.

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:03.710
I am shamed...

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:08.390
Your Majesty, I am truly sorry...

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:13.890
My debt to you... to my father...
I could not...

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:17.030
The father who raised you...

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:18.860
A debt to your family...

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:25.090
But, sorry to say,

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:27.930
I'm fighting for something like that, too.

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:36.960
So pathetic, you could cry?

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:41.460
Why, then, do you wish to protect Victor?

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:46.590
I truly cannot understand humans.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:48.080
I'll tell you.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:52.720
Being impossible to understand 
is what makes humans human!

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:54.290
Slow Down.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:59.540
True Rain of a Thousand Camps!

00:13:58.400 --> 00:13:59.190
<b>Speed Up</b>

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:11.370
What?!

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:21.150
It ate my technique itself?!

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:23.270
Oh-ho...

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:25.990
I'd like to know more about you, too.

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:26.960
By all means.

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:31.080
Kiri, he separates himself from 
the Horologues to eat time!

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.040
Be careful!

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.370
I can see that easily.

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:36.850
Victor, you just stay there.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:40.190
Eternal Eaters!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:40.190
Eternal Eaters

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.620
They really do eat everything.

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:00.880
This is no more than play.

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:02.380
Do you wish to keep going?

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:03.460
Of course I do.

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:08.220
I don't intend to stop 
until I've defeated you!

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:11.340
My goodness. I just don't understand.

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:20.390
I will observe this strange thing 
at my leisure after eating it.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:21.120
Kiri!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:28.280
I'd rather you didn't just decide 
where I'm going on your own.

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:30.320
Release Slow Down!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.410
<i>It's still not working?</i>

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:50.470
Am I correct in thinking you've resolved 
to stop resisting and let me eat you?

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:53.840
If you want to know, find out for yourself.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:58.060
Interesting. I will gladly do just that!

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:14.030
You aren't using your sword?

00:16:14.430 --> 00:16:17.420
I Sped Up the evaporation 
of water in the earth

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:19.160
and turned it into many blades.

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:23.420
I didn't expect it to take down a Horologue.

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:26.630
But even if you are capable 
of healing yourself,

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:28.690
it has to consume energy.

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:31.520
I just need to finish you 
before you can heal yourself.

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:33.180
It's over.

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:40.100
What you're feeling now is an 
emotion humans call "fear."

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:54.090
Was that healing?

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:57.940
No. He ate his own time,

00:16:57.940 --> 00:17:00.370
reverting to the state he was 
in before I damaged him!

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:05.290
<i>We've never met a Horologue with 
that kind of power before!</i>

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:11.520
Only very few Horologues can heal themselves 
by eating part of their own bodies.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:16.490
I feel a bit ill, but this 
instantly returns me to normal.

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:18.390
It's quite wonderful!

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:23.600
<i>Still, I can't give up now!</i>

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:26.520
Kiri!

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:34.350
Haven't you had enough? 
Just let it eat you now.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:46.040
Kiri!

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:50.540
Even injury does not deter you 
from fighting your enemy.

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:52.830
Truly, I am surprised.

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:54.300
But...

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:57.300
I believe you have no moves left to try.

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:05.350
Ah, yes...

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:07.620
That expression!

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:10.710
I have done so much experimentation 
and observation

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:14.110
in order to understand human emotions.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:17.860
Humans smile when they are suffering,

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:20.870
grieve when someone they hate leaves them,

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:24.330
and sometimes, they even say 
things they don't mean.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.210
And you...

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:30.330
continue to attack me when 
you have no chance of winning.

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.330
You even injured yourself,

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:36.590
when if you had stopped resisting, 
you would never have felt that pain.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:41.330
The more I observe them, the less 
I understand human emotions.

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:44.720
I can't make logical sense of it at all.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:47.850
But there's one thing I am certain of.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:51.830
In the many thousands of 
experiments I've conducted,

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:55.360
whenever humans have sensed 
approaching death,

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:58.110
they always made that expression.

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:02.870
That... is "fear"!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.490
Scared, aren't you?

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:07.490
As well you should be.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:13.380
The one human emotion I 
do understand is fear...

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:21.340
And that, for me, is the 
most precious asset of all!

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:22.090
Kiri!

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:44.700
Aiks brought our family back together.
We owe him everything.

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:49.460
Victor, were you always so ungrateful?

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.460
Dad...

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:58.180
You're wrong, Dad! Kiri is in danger!

00:19:58.180 --> 00:19:59.840
I have to help him!

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.280
Then what about us?

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:10.210
If you kill Aiks, we'll disappear forever.

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:11.350
Is that what you want?

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:19.840
Even after becoming an adult,

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:21.900
you're still as selfish as ever.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:45.990
<i>Get it together!</i>

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:48.520
<i>Mom and Dad are already dead!</i>

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:52.140
<i>I can't save Kiri if I 
stay trapped in the past!</i>

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.650
I'm Very Proud

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:03.900
That Vic Has Grown

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.160
To Be Such an

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:10.910
Independent Boy

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:12.760
I...

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:17.980
I am

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:20.420
a victor!

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:27.340
I won't borrow strength from anyone else.

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:30.300
I'll claim victory with my own strength.

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:32.180
I am the absolute victor!

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:34.580
Just as my mother wished, I will fight

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:36.440
and win!

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:37.900
Ace Shot!

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:37.900
<b>Speed Up</b>

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:44.400
Time to say goodbye, Vic.

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:51.450
The Transcendence of the Ego

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:54.660
The Transcendence of the Ego

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:54.700
The Transcendence of the Ego

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:54.790
The Transcendence of the Ego

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:54.870
The Transcendence of the Ego

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:40.170
Process and Reality
